}

\subsection{Official Documentation}{

\href{https://developers.binance.com/docs/binance-spot-api-docs/rest-api/general-endpoints#check-server-time}{Binance Check Server Time}
Verified: 2026-05-22
}

\subsection{Automated Trading Usage}{
\itemize{
\item \strong{Clock Drift Detection}: Compare server time against local clock to detect drift.
\item \strong{Auth Debugging}: Binance tolerates \code{recvWindow} (default 5s); verify timestamps are in range.
\item \strong{Heartbeat}: Lightweight endpoint (weight 1) suitable for connectivity health checks.
}
}

